        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We market and sell our products through our direct sales force and in partnership with our channel partners, including distributors, value-added resellers, systems integrators and original equipment manufacturer (\"OEM\") partners.",
